;;; EXERCISE

;;; ---------------------------------------------------------

#|
1. Write a melody of 8 pitches.
2. Create 4 versions of it: 
  a) original, 
  b) transposed by 6, 
  c) transposed by -1 and reversed, 
  d) transposed 11 and inverted.
3. Concatenate the four versions
4. Range them to flute and to doublebass 
|#